license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://abruix.github.io/phase-explorer/"
abstract: >
  An interactive single-page phase diagram explorer for water, CO₂,
  and isobutane. Tap or click any point on the P–T diagram to read
  the phase and thermodynamic properties (density, enthalpy, entropy,
  Gibbs free energy). Built for pedagogical use.
